# LS_Warden_330_SSF.filter - rarity-first SSF campaign / mapping filter
# Revision: 3.30 league drop highlights and Wombgift coverage, 2026-11-20. Normal PoE 1, not Ruthless.
# NORMAL = WHITE | MAGIC = BLUE | RARE = YELLOW | UNIQUE = ORANGE
# BORDERS: cyan claw, purple links, pink 5/6L, green compact RGB recipe.
# COVENS: pink Viscera and Queen fragment, purple-bordered Fated items.
# THREADS: cyan label and minimap icon. Reworked league rewards have explicit rules.
# BREACH: lavender Wombgifts with a purple beam and minimap icon.
# Rarity palette rules Continue; equipment rules preserve their text colors.
# All equipment remains visible through AREA level 32 (Acts 1-3).
# All rares/uniques and unmatched non-equipment stay visible at every level.
# No custom sound files or external filter imports required.
# Copy this file to the game's filter folder; select it and Reload in Options.
# Source syntax: https://www.pathofexile.com/item-filter/about
# 3.30 classes and base types: https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013923

# BREACH GENESIS TREE REWARDS: ALL WOMBGIFT BASES
Show
    BaseType "Wombgift"
    SetTextColor 235 205 255 255
    SetBorderColor 205 135 255 255
    SetBackgroundColor 35 12 54 255
    SetFontSize 45
    PlayEffect Purple
    MinimapIcon 0 Purple Circle

# RARITY PALETTE: Normal (preserved by equipment rules)
Show
    Rarity Normal
    SetTextColor 230 230 230 255
    SetBorderColor 90 90 90 255
    SetBackgroundColor 8 10 14 235
    SetFontSize 32
    Continue

# RARITY PALETTE: Magic (preserved by equipment rules)
Show
    Rarity Magic
    SetTextColor 136 136 255 255
    SetBorderColor 69 69 140 255
    SetBackgroundColor 10 12 32 245
    SetFontSize 33
    Continue

# RARITY PALETTE: Rare (preserved by equipment rules)
Show
    Rarity Rare
    SetTextColor 255 255 85 255
    SetBorderColor 232 189 48 255
    SetBackgroundColor 48 38 0 250
    SetFontSize 39
    Continue

# RARITY PALETTE: Unique (preserved by equipment rules)
Show
    Rarity Unique
    SetTextColor 255 140 40 255
    SetBorderColor 255 140 40 255
    SetBackgroundColor 48 19 6 250
    SetFontSize 42
    Continue

# VISCERA: ALL WICKERMAN BODY PARTS, EVERY TIER AND AREA LEVEL
# Match the item class, not equipment slots or individual body-part names.
# Terminal rule: later equipment/rarity rules must not override this style.
Show
    Class == "Viscera"
    SetTextColor 255 130 220 255
    SetBorderColor 255 40 170 255
    SetBackgroundColor 40 5 25 255
    SetFontSize 45
    PlayAlertSound 4 250
    PlayEffect Pink
    MinimapIcon 0 Pink Kite

