    Rarity <= Rare
    HasExplicitMod "Veil" "Citaqualotl" "Guatelitzi" "Matatl" "Puhuarte" "Tacati" "Topotante" "Xopec" "of the Underground" "Subterranean" "of Farrul" "of Fenumus" "of Craiceann" "of Saqawal"
